; kindcaches.eval - the kind caches (code-review C302, C330, C347). Judged by
; tools/EditorTest.py phase 51, on its scratch world, into whose catalogs the
; judge writes four things first (the editor would refuse the first now, and
; the rest are what the checks are about):
;   decorations.cat [portcullis]  a decoration under the DOOR's id (a copy of
;                                 [portcullis_grate]), as every world shipped it
;                                 until the rename;
;   items.cat [et_kenaz]          a rune tablet - category rune, symbol air -
;                                 whose id is NOT rune_<symbol>;
;   effects.cat [light] icon = rune_light   the line every world shipped until
;                                 the effect classes carried their own rune;
;   effects.cat [poison] icon = apple       an effect's item override (a control).
;
;   --- weapon ---   in a frozen arena corridor, the dagger's details open and
;                    read, and a dagger thrown: in the air, it is read back.
;   --- weapon saved --- its damage saved through the type editor (`typeset`)
;                    WITH THE DETAILS STILL OPEN: the save closes them (their
;                    preview held the model the rebuild frees), and the dagger in
;                    the air reads back through the pointer its flight held -
;                    the kind is rebuilt IN PLACE, where an erase and rebuild
;                    leaves the flight holding freed memory.
;   --- weapon landed --- it lands as a dagger, and the reopened details show the
;                    new number at once. An item's kind was never rebuilt by a
;                    save (the save cleared a DECORATION's cache entry of that id),
;                    so it showed only after a reload.
;   --- rune ---     et_kenaz draws as the air rune - its carved tablet in a
;                    socket, the glyph where a control asks - and, given to
;                    Maren, its details offer Memorize, which learns air and
;                    spends it; a second one then offers none. Memorize and the
;                    icon both went by the id's `rune_` spelling.
;   --- kit ---      rune_light renamed et_sowilo: a new game's casters carry
;                    et_sowilo (the kit named rune_<symbol> ids outright, which
;                    the world no longer had), `rune light` gives it, and it
;                    draws as a tablet. The Sowilo light's effect icon still
;                    wears the Sowilo glyph though its `icon` names rune_light,
;                    gone now - and a ward its Protect glyph, poison its item,
;                    a burn the tinted square.
;   --- portcullis --- the door portcullis in a doorway, then the decoration
;                    portcullis beside it: `propkinds` lists TWO kinds, each
;                    with its own catalog's model and set (one cache by bare id
;                    gave the second the first's).
;   --- related ---  an id a RELATED catalog holds is refused: a decoration
;                    named wooden_door (a door), a weapon named torch (an item),
;                    a door duplicated as portcullis_grate (a decoration), a
;                    door renamed portcullis_grate and a weapon renamed apple;
;                    beside them a weapon created, and one renamed, under free
;                    ids (the controls).
;
; `lang en` because the judge rebuilds each refusal from en.lang; it puts
; settings.ini back (the language saves).

logecho on
reset
lang en
echo --- weapon ---
timescale 0
arena corridor 11
tp 10 12
face e
itemdetails dagger
itemdetails rows
throw dagger
flooritems all
echo --- weapon saved ---
typeset weapons dagger damage 9.5
itemdetails status
flooritems all
echo --- weapon landed ---
step 3
flooritems all
itemdetails dagger
itemdetails rows
itemdetails off
timescale 1
echo --- rune ---
itemicon et_kenaz
itemicon et_kenaz symbolic
give et_kenaz 2
inventory status
itemdetails pack 2 3
itemdetails status
itemdetails memorize
inventory status
give et_kenaz 2
itemdetails pack 2 3
itemdetails status
itemdetails off
echo --- kit ---
typeset rename items rune_light et_sowilo
reset
inventory status
rune light
itemicon et_sowilo
itemicon effect light
itemicon effect stoneskin
itemicon effect poison
itemicon effect burn
echo --- portcullis ---
arena corridor 11
tp 10 12
face e
editor place doors portcullis 12 12
editor place decorations portcullis 14 12
propkinds
echo --- related ---
newasset decorations installed portcullis wooden_door
newasset weapons installed viking_dagger torch
newasset doors duplicate wooden_door portcullis_grate
newasset weapons installed viking_dagger et_free_weapon
newasset off
expect-refuse typeset rename doors wooden_door portcullis_grate
expect-refuse typeset rename weapons dagger apple
typeset rename weapons khukri et_free_khukri
echo --- end ---
